Name: fast_float
URL: https://github.com/fastfloat/fast_float
Version: 8.3.2
Revision: 42f254836ee416ffcf2f4e6576260003ac33d48c
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE-MIT
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Locale-independent decimal-to-binary floating-point conversion with exact
rounding, including ties to even. Used by the outlined JSON number parser;
V8 retains its small-integer scanner and its original invalid-number error
path. The generic StringToDouble path is unchanged.

Local changes:
None to upstream headers. Only include/fast_float and the three upstream license
files are vendored from the pinned release. BUILD.gn and this metadata are local.
